Project Development

Development Process

The Auto Ticket Classification System is developed to automatically categorize support tickets based on their descriptions.

Development Steps

1. Collect the required ticket dataset.
2. Clean and preprocess the ticket data.
3. Prepare the data for classification.
4. Train the classification model.
5. Test the trained model.
6. Accept a new ticket from the user.
7. Process the ticket description.
8. Predict the appropriate ticket category.
9. Display the classification result.

Example

Ticket Description:
Unable to connect to Wi-Fi.

Predicted Category:
Network Issue

Expected Output

The system analyzes the submitted ticket and automatically displays the most appropriate category.
